window.products.push({"id":1033016,"name":"puredown Feather and Down Comforter King Size Lightweight Downproof 100% Cotton Cover Ultra-Soft Duvet Insert","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bPyq8wPCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👉【100% Cotton Cover】- 100% cotton cover feels incredibly soft and smooth while staying breathable, noiseless when moving, you can feel like sleeping on the clouds.  It is skin-friendly, sensitive skin people can also use it with confidence. Sleep soundly all year long with this medium warmth duvet insert. 👉【Premium Filling】 - This comforter is filled with sufficient feather and down (95/5), which are ethically sourced and RDS, OEKO-Tex Standard 100 certified, for all-natural comfort you can feel good about. It keeps you warm without adding extra weight and bulk and exceeds your sleep expectations providing you with year-round enjoyment. 👉【Lightweight Comforter】 - Warm weather sleepers and those who prefer to sleep cool can still enjoy our lightweight comforter. Combines softness, comfort, and breathability, this comforter prevents overheating, keeps you cool, dry, and warm, helps you wake refreshed. 3 choices is available - Twin Size: 68*88”, 40.8 oz fill weight; - Full/Queen Size: 88*88”, 52.9 oz fill weight; - King Size: 104*88”, 62.5 oz fill weight. 👉【Exquisite Details】- Box-stitched design keeps the filling in place for maximum warmth, without any clumping. Corner Tabs help secure the comforter in place, prevent shifting, superior double-needle stitch avoids leakage, makes the comforter more durable, ensures a stable and comfortable sleep. 👉【Care Instruction】- Dry Cleaning. Clean your comforter as infrequently as possible, as this can also damage the down filling. Spot cleaning stains is also a great way to extend the time between washings. Since the down comforter is vacuum packed, it is recommended to spread it for a few hours and pat or shake gently by holding each end to fully expand. This increases airflow and helps stop the clumping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bPyq8wPCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"puredown","source_asin":"B097CWZJYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097CWZJYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097CWZJYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
