window.products.push({"id":1033033,"name":"Pinion Pine Scented 15 Hour Soy Votive Candles (6-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41by5qhSfxL._AC_.jpg","description":"~Scent Description:The Pinion pine grows in the Southwestern United States and in Mexico. The trees yield edible pinyon nuts, which were a staple of the Native Americans, and are still widely eaten. The fragrant Piñon Pine aroma easily creates a forest atmosphere for those longing for the all-natural scent of an evergreen grove~ Votive candles must be burned in an appropriately sized votive holder to achieve maximum burn time. My candles are not made by mechanically pressing wax granules into a mold like many of the high-volume sellers do. I hand-pour every candle and place every wick made of 100% cotton, by hand using only High Quality Soy Wax and American Manufactured products! MADE IN THE USA!!!Each of these votives measure 1 3/4\" Diameter and are 2\" Tall. Each Candle will burn a minimum of 15+ Hours in appropriate Holder and normal indoor environment. **Please be aware that I make my candles in small batches and my colors may not be consistent with my photographs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41by5qhSfxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jaime K. Candle Co.","source_asin":"B01N7XEN65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7XEN65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N7XEN65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
