window.products.push({"id":1033165,"name":"Air Fryer Paper Liners Disposable, 200PCS 7.9 Inch Air Fryer Paper Liners Round, Natural Parchment Paper for Air Fryer, Non-stick, Oil-proof, Paper Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150LrvwoVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤【Non-stick & Easy to Clean】Our disposable paper liners will keep your air fryer as clean as unused. If you hate cleaning after baking, just take one out and put it in your air fryer. Parchment paper liners heightened edge 1.77 inches, can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. ➤【Material & Features】These air fryer parchment paper made of food-grade wood pulp and silicone oil coating, unbleached, no fluorescent agent, BPA-free. With the features of waterproof, oil-proof, non-sticky and can better protect your air fryer, suitable for all your baking needs. ➤【Multipurpose】These parchment paper liners are not easy to paste into the pot after baking, the baked food does not stick to the paper. So they are great for baking, roasting, frying, air fryer, steamer, frying pan, microwave and serving foods. ➤【Package Include】200 pcs paper liners, sufficient quantities offer a wide range of choices for your daily baking and replacement needs. Except for the paper liners, which also include 1x oil brush and 1 x food tong, we hope these tools will help you make more delicious food. ➤【Buying Guide】These airfryer parchment paper bottom wide 7.9 inches, perfects for 4.2-5.8 quart air fryer. We advise measure your air fryer bottom to make sure that the paper is fit. ▲【Attention】Do not put parchment paper in the air fryer basket without food while preheating or the fan will suck them up and fire can easily occur. The heat resistant up to 428℉, please always use with enough food on the paper liners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150LrvwoVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zelova","source_asin":"B09Y1GN5M2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1GN5M2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1GN5M2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
