window.products.push({"id":1033259,"name":"Portable Blender, Mini Blender For Shakes and Smoothies, Personal Blender USB Rechargeable, Fresh Juice Blender With 8 Blades, 12oz Handheld Blender F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W1Of8tAhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart Safety Protection: Elechelf personal size blender embraces a unique safety design including safety indication light, induction automatic stop design, silicone charging port protection. Power-off protection, overload protection ,overheating prevention give you a duplicate protection while making delicious juice. Powerful Ice Cube Blending: The juicer cup is equipped with 8 pcs 304 stainless steel blades and strong power system, uniform mixing, quick speed and long life, it only takes 40 seconds to bring you fresh smoothie, protein and milk shakes, fresh juices, masks, grate cheese, mince garlic, and even make frozen cocktails. If you love cold drinks, this fresh juice blender will be good choice ! Compact Design: Portable smoothie blender built-in USB rechargeable can be easily charged by power bank, wall charge, computer or other USB devices. 12oz capacity and only 1 lb product weight is easy to carry around in any circumstances, portable for traveling, camping, fishing, home and office, travel with on-the-go portability. Eco-friendly Material: All parts of the mini blender are BPA-free to ensure healthy and safe drinking. More durable non-toxic material is suitable for healthy lifestyle lovers. By detachable blade component, cleaning is more convenient and easier. Portable & Easy To Clean: One Button blending/cleaning, just put some water in the cup, press the button to start automatic cleaning. Portable blender cup is detachable, easy to clean, easy to flush, ideal for office, gym, outdoors,traveling, camping or fishing. Note: For your safety, the motor of the juicing cup needs to cooperate with the cup body to work, and it will not work alone..","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W1Of8tAhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elechelf","source_asin":"B0BC82R9KG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BC82R9KG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BC82R9KG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1033260,"name":"Marble Field Metal Standing Towel Ladder, 4-Layer Storage Towel Rack, Wall Display Rack, Bathroom Decoration, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jQH2vJ7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dimensions - Color: White  - Product Size: 16.5\"W x 1\"D x 59\"H - Product Weight: 5.6 b Material: iron Product Description The metal towel rack has a novel design . It is a standing towel rack, which not only adds storage space to your house, but also increases the decor of the room. The towel rack has 4 layers of horizontal bars for hanging towels, blankets, scarves, clothes and newspapers. This towel rack is easy to install and easy to use. After the product is installed, you can use it directly against the wall. You can move its position at will according to your needs. The four rubber holsters at both ends of the towel rack not only increase the friction with the ground, but also protect the wall from scratches. This product is a storage household product, please do not use it for climbing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jQH2vJ7RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marble Field","source_asin":"B08L7L5QSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L7L5QSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L7L5QSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
