window.products.push({"id":1033415,"name":"Tupperware potatoe masher black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JO+9HU8mL._AC_.jpg","description":"Mashed potatoes or fruit compote are child's play with this \"pureeing master\"! Since the handle is in the middle of the tamping surface, the force from the handle is distributed particularly well over the entire surface and you can work effortlessly! Benefits: With the pureeing master: tamping is easy, you can also get into deep containers, you only need a little space for stowing. The handle is attached in the middle, which enables optimal power transmission and good guidance. The oval openings give the pounded space to come up, nothing splatters. The puree maker has an oval, flat shape, which you can use to get into the corners of bowls and pots. The bottom is arched up in the middle, so z. B. the potato is not gone. Can be hung from the opening on the handle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31JO+9HU8mL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tupperware","source_asin":"B01JEQVI8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JEQVI8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JEQVI8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
