window.products.push({"id":1033474,"name":"VILA Stainless Steel Travel Tumbler, Double Wall Vacuum Insulated, Tight Transparent Lid Restricts Spillage, Keeps Hot Drinks Hot and Cold Drinks Cold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1DB283zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What type of liquids can I put in my tumbler? The versatile 20 ounce Stainless Steel Tumbler by Vila is designed to hold a wide variety of liquids from piping hot tea to icy cold water. This handy double wall insulated cup can be used to keep juice cool while having a family picnic. Refresh yourself by sipping in the hot coffee as you wait for the deer to come in or the fish to bite. Fill it with ice, water and lemons for a refreshing beverage during the day, then give the portable cup a quick rinse and fill it back with your favorite mixed drink to sip on around the campfire. How do I maintain this tumbler? Inside and out, the insulated tumbler is very easy to maintain and reuse. Both the tumbler and the lid are dishwasher compatible. For any fingerprints, simply wipe off the shiny stainless steel exterior. If you are in a hurry, you can simply rinse with soap and water and refill with another of your favorite beverages. Where can I take the Vila Stainless Steel Tumbler? Engineered to be nearly indestructible, the 20 oz insulated tumbler from Vila is ideal for potentially unstable environments such as construction sites, in the deer stand or on the boat. Because it is lightweight and portable, it is also excellent in the office, around the campfire or for everyday use in your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61K1DB283zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VILA","source_asin":"B07MHDWQRZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHDWQRZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHDWQRZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
