window.products.push({"id":1033498,"name":"Kwizing Made In Japan Fish Bone Tweezers (2-pack) - Non-Slip, Precision Grip - Debone Salmon, Bass, Catfish - Stainless Steel Handmade Japanese Crafts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VlBckAuLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy delicious fish free of bones and scales by removing them effortlessly with Kwizing Fish Bone Tweezers. If you love fish, you know there’s nothing more annoying than trying to debone a fish with a filet knife, or biting into a bone after you’ve spent hours preparing dinner. That’s why you need Kwizing Fish Bone Tweezers that let you quickly and easily remove bones and scales with little effort. Professional Quality Deboning Tweezers Handcrafted in Japan by Japanese craftsman, our stainless steel fish scale tweezers are larger and easier to hold so you can deftly remove bones or scales with just a few squeezes. In fact, they feature curved “jaws” that make pulling out bones better because it won’t damage the meat in the process. Enjoy Tastier Fish Whether you’re an avid angler or just love a good fish dinner, there’s nothing more important to your kitchen and your fishing box than a good set of Kwizing Fish Bone Tweezers. Easy to clean, highly durable, and with a precision grip that lets you remove even the tiniest of bones with ease, you’ll find that fish tastes far better when you don’t have to worry about biting into a bone. Product Details: Stainless Steel Stainless Steel Handmade in Japan Handmade in Japan High-Tensile Strength High-Tensile Strength Curved, Non-Slip Grip Curved, Non-Slip Grip Comfortable, Ergonomic Design Comfortable, Ergonomic Design Size: 4.75” x .05” x .75” Size: 4.75” x .05” x .75” Weight: 0.2 oz. Weight: 0.2 oz. Satisfaction Guarantee Satisfaction Guarantee Click ‘Add to Cart’ now to get specially designed tweezers for deboning salmon, bass and your other favorite fish!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VlBckAuLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kwizing","source_asin":"B01MCQTO8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MCQTO8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MCQTO8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
