window.products.push({"id":1033543,"name":"Great Plate Reusable Plastic Plates for Parties with Built-In Cup Holder - Set of 6 Party Plates and Cups for Kids or Adults, Food Serving Tray with D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f7QXtbO0L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"{The Ultimate Party Tableware} Great Plate reusable plastic dinner plates come with a unique built-in cup holder which is also a wine glass holder, so you can carry your food and drink comfortably in one hand. The set of 6 colorful washable plastic plates and matching 20oz plastic cups are unbreakable, untippable, and 10 inches large to hold all your snacks or entrees. {Ideal Size and Versatility} Great Plate reusable divided plates have a built-in cup holder designed for the 20oz Great Cup, but will also nicely fit a bottle, wine glass, can, or other plastic or paper cups. A convenient replacement for paper plates or disposable party plates, each set comes with 6 square plastic reusable plates and 6 matching cups available in multiple bright colors. {Proudly Made in the USA} GreatPlate plastic serving plates are dishwasher safe, microwave safe, and made from food-grade BPA-free polypropylene which makes them 100% recyclable. As tough as melamine or wheat straw dinnerware sets but far more versatile. You'll love the quality of our non disposable plastic plates and food trays for kids and adults. Contact us with any customer care inquiries. {Perfect for Any Event} Do away with flimsy paper plates and replace them with sturdy reusable plastic plates and cups that are suitable for tailgate parties, picnics, BBQ parties, patio parties, receptions, family reunions, camping, beach parties or as a kids snack plate. Whether on the couch watching TV, on the boat, or in the car, keep your food and drinks upright and accessible. {Get Ready for the Party} Get ready for the next tailgate party or outdoor gathering with enough Great Plates heavy duty reusable tableware for you and all your friends. Use colors instead of wine charms or drink labels to identify your drink. Whether a kids party or an adult party, our eco-friendly party plates and cups will mean no more embarrassing spills or cup-and-plate balancing acts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61f7QXtbO0L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Great Plate","source_asin":"B09MZN33RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MZN33RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MZN33RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
