window.products.push({"id":1033607,"name":"Haussmann® Wood Wave Verve Accent Snake Table 12 x14 x 20 in H Oak Oil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W9UplCr+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Need a unique functional one of a kind accent table that doubles as a display stand? This unique wave, verve, or snake accent table features a unique and amazing combination of form and function. Hard to tell if it should be heralded as an engineering feat, be placed in museum of impressionist art, or be enjoyed for any purpose you desire. Try as an entry way table or display stand. Hand carved, hand finished with natural oil. Each one is truly one-of-a-kind, so consider two. At 12 inches x 14 inches and 20 inches high finished in golden Oak tone Oil Hand rubbed in natural nontoxic Oak (golden) oil. Color ranges from medium to dark Golden Oak and brown tones that will darken as the wood ages *Please Note* There will be various separations or cracks and color will vary from the pictures depicted for every single piece. No two pieces will match *YOU WILL NOT RECEIVE THE PIECE PICTURED. AS THAT IS JUST A REPRESENTATION OF THE DESIGN AND FINISH TONE. There will be visible marks from carving, patches from repairs, knot holes, natural inclusions, and worm holes. There will be various separations or cracks on your piece when it arrives. They naturally occurred as the wood was dried. Over time, continued shrinkage will accentuate existing separations or generate new ones. This does not compromise the structural performance or integrity of the wood and is considered inherent to the natural beauty of the design.The handcrafted touch of artisan skill creates variations in color, size and design. Color discrepancies will occur between the product and your computer screen Hand made from start to finish. 100% Sustainable eco friendly woods and finishes Each piece hand carved from a solid piece of sustainable wood. Craftspeople from the Chiang Mai area in Northern Thailand create these one-of-a-kind pieces with the simplest of tools. Each piece is a unique creation, more than a piece of furniture…it is a Work of Art Only listed product included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W9UplCr+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haussmann","source_asin":"B00GOKULKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GOKULKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GOKULKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
