window.products.push({"id":1033711,"name":"Lumaland Bed Pads for Incontinence or Other Medical Issues Washable Disposable Waterproof Large Mattress Protector for Adults and Children Extremely C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YfY3LbdVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dry bed linen all night Restful and continuous sleep is indispensable for us all - but what if you have to continually pester with the idea of wet bed sheets? Then the Lumaland incontinence pads are the perfect solution. Thanks to the extra-thick four-layer coating, the pads have maximum absorbency and can quickly absorb several liters of liquid. With their comfortable size of 34\"x52\" they cover enough space in the bed, so you don’t need to worry about an unpleasant awakening. The sheet on the mattress is correctly protected and in the next morning just as dry as before falling asleep. Of course, other sizes are also available, so you can adjust the pads individually to your bed. Multiple uses are possible without problems Due to high-quality processing, the pads are very durable and can be used several hundred times. Thanks to the durable cotton-polyester blend, a single pad can be used for almost an entire year, which is a big plus regarding sustainability. Pleasant feeling when sleeping The Lumaland incontinence pads are particularly soft and create a thoroughly comfortable feeling at night. The temperature of the pads is just right: even under a blanket, you will not be too hot if you lie on the pad - the special surface makes it possible. Whether you are dealing with incontinence, other medical reasons, or infants, the pads are suitable for a variety of different occasions and also provide the best protection zone for sheets and mattresses. For pets sleeping in the bed, they are a proper solution too. Care instructions The Lumaland incontinence pads can be easily washed in the washing machine. They are also suitable for the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YfY3LbdVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lumaland","source_asin":"B074WZ2LB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074WZ2LB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074WZ2LB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
