window.products.push({"id":1033913,"name":"Alloech Twin Mattress, 10 Inch Gel Memory Foam Innerspring Hybrid Twin Size Bed Mattress in a Box for Cool Sleep & Pressure Relief, Motion Isolation, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XvsiHYbiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【No Pain & No Interference】:Independently wrapped spring and foam layer can effectively reduce noise and prevent shaking. When you sleep, you can align your spine and evenly distribute your weight to relieve pressure points. Tossing and turning, getting in and out of bed will not disturb others, ensuring you a quiet and undisturbed sleep. The ergonomic support design is very suitable for side-lying, supine and prone sleeping positions, saying goodbye to back pain. 【Breathable & Heat dissipation】: Adaptive memory foam adjusts slowly according to your weight and temperature to cool down and decompress sleep. The high-quality ice silk fabric adapts to the environment and keeps the surface of the mattress at an ideal sleeping temperature; reduces sweat in hot or humid weather, allowing you to sleep comfortably all night. Completely solve the thermal shortcomings of traditional memory foam mattresses. 【Safety & Health】: You can rest assured to sleep on this hybrid foam mattress king, because all foams are certified by CertiPUR-US and do not contain harmful substances. The exquisite knitted fabric resists pilling, is skin-friendly and durable. This king bed hybrid mattress is suitable for everyone, including pregnant women and children. Do not have alarmed if you experience a “fresh foam” odor. It is harmless and will dissipate in a few days. 【Easy Shipping & Set-up】: Mattress in a box, this luxurious Twin size mattress is compressed and smartly shipped in a box for convenient delivery and setup. They fit all Twin size frames, such as box Spring, floor, slatted base, flat platform. Please give it in24-72 hours to expand to its full size. 【No Risk & Worth Recommending】: As the brand owner and maker, the best price Mattress you can get. Our bed mattresses go with 10 years. If there is any reason you are unsatisfied with your order, please contact US at any time. Over 98% of our customers are willing to keep their Twin size mattress and refer it to others.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XvsiHYbiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alloech","source_asin":"B09NBMJHBC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBMJHBC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBMJHBC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
