window.products.push({"id":1033947,"name":"IYUEGO Modern Minimalist Stripe Pattern Jacquard Blackout Grommet Top Curtain with Multi Size Custom 50\" W x 84\" L (Set of 1)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519zHddGYSL._AC_.jpg","description":"TOP CONSTRUCTION GUIDE: For Grommet, the inside diameter of Grommet is 1.6\", around 6-8 grommets in a 40 inches wide curtain. The grommet ring is nickel in silver. For Tab top, the height of tab is 4\" (10cm). There are about 6-8 tabs in a 40 inch wide curtain.For Rod Pocket, come with 2\" header, and the height of pocket is 3\" (8cm) to ensure the rod could pass through.For the Double Pleated, there are around 6-8 pleats AND firm plastic hooks in a 40 inches wide curtain. Come with firm plastic hooks.If say the width is 84 inches in the size list, for double pleated, that means the panel width at the top with 6-8 pleats already set in the panel. MEASUREMENT INSTRUCTION: For grommet and tab top curtain, measure the drop from the top of pole to where you want curtain to finish.For Pleated top construction, measure the distance from the eye where the curtain hooks attched to where you want your curtan to finish.For rod pocket, measure the distance from the top of pole to where you want curtain to finish. Curtain Width: We suggest You choose a curtain width 2 times wider than the width of the pole or tacck to create folds. For example, if the pole or track is 42 inches, then select a curtain width of 84 inches or 2 panels 42 inches each. Top Construction: Grommet Top Features: Blackout Color: As Per Picture Fabric Type: Polyester Crafts: Embossed Solid Fabric Weight: 250 gram/square meter ( Medium ) Includes: 1 Panel Care Instruction: Machine Wash, Do not Bleach, Warm Iron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519zHddGYSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IYUEGO","source_asin":"B011EKP8AQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1033947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011EKP8AQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011EKP8AQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
